[{"title":"和奇父竹斋小池及游春五绝 其三","author":"胡寅","text":"不瞻犀柄动经旬，忽报巾车独辗春。\n曾作天津歌酒伴，此间谁是识花人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41947,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和奇父竹斋小池及游春五绝 其五","author":"胡寅","text":"东风不放两般春，只系胸怀故与新。\n为问漆园蝴蝶梦，何如沂水舞雩人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41948,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和奇父竹斋小池及游春五绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"绿竹丛边筑小塘，泉来何处已洸洸。\n未涵北户星辰影，斗觉南风藻荇香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41949,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和奇父壁间留题","author":"胡寅","text":"竹杖轻坚野服宽，岁寒应得见苍官。\n世情无限残霜叶，昨日青青今日丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41950,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其十","author":"胡寅","text":"畴昔黄金入汉宫，只今娇额为谁容。\n嫦娥也觅孤栖伴，并照巫阳十二峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41951,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其八","author":"胡寅","text":"清溪练练影全呈，绝胜斜梢出竹横。\n便是霓裳临晓镜，搔头初插未行行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41952,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其六","author":"胡寅","text":"泼落琼华作雨濛，迷离高树映寒空。\n莫寻云外瑶台侣，且对尊前鹤发翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41953,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其九","author":"胡寅","text":"意态冲寒不自持，桂华相伴亦多时。\n未须细睹青春面，且看扶疏写影宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41954,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"间错浮筠冷更严，长松低顾拂苍髯。\n清标总是君朋侣，桃李相望几陛廉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41955,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其十二","author":"胡寅","text":"博山汤气馥笼寒，裛尽啼痕作醉欢。\n赏去角巾从小垫，接䍦何惜一生酸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41956,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其四","author":"胡寅","text":"未开疏蕊著诗催，依约蜂声欲隐雷。\n姑射坐中亲绰约，岭头空有路萦回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41957,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其五","author":"胡寅","text":"六出谁人剪刻成，侵凌飘洒正纵横。\n仙姿不赖相黏缀，浣尽浮埃艳更明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41958,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其十一","author":"胡寅","text":"若道残冬不是春，洗妆那得一枝新。\n杏园芳洒真憔悴，争似而今敛路尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41959,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其三","author":"胡寅","text":"欣逢冷艳破冬温，更待飞霙涤昼昏。\n剩欲约君移酒处，小桥斜过竹边门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41960,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和坚伯梅六题一孤芳二山间三雪中四水边五月下六雨后每题二绝禁犯本题及风花雪月天粉玉香山水字十二绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"折绵威力漫相侵，根暖怡然独秀林。\n万紫千红非我对，为渠无有岁寒心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41961,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和赵庙欲携尊赏残梅二绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"为惜纷纷作雪飞，忍看桃李便芳菲。\n小瓶留得春风面，尚可携壶一醉归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41962,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和赵庙欲携尊赏残梅二绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"离离疏蕊抱寒条，开晚浑疑雪未消。\n风雨助君悭且涩，吹将诗句淡相撩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41963,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和钱孙叔委心亭二绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"交衢尘雾祗相煎，回首山林去未缘。\n安得委心无一事，陪公清话许忘年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41964,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉家君自胜业迁居书堂久雨乍晴道中口占","author":"胡寅","text":"五峰收卷万层云，一水流通四海春。\n南极有星天地久，东风无际柳梅均。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41965,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"朱楼深稳可凭栏，万顷波光一目间。\n不见惊鸿偏凤髻，空馀天鉴写云鬟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41966,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"沅澧澬湘此并行，涨流洄薄又东倾。\n西南或与天为际，禹贡如何不记名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41967,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其四","author":"胡寅","text":"祖龙游豫亦荒哉，风折云帆促驾回。\n一怒赭山何所损，依然苍翠似蓬莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41968,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其十二","author":"胡寅","text":"范公才具济川舟，翰墨居然第一流。\n每向遗文窥远意，愿言忧乐继前修。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41969,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其十一","author":"胡寅","text":"李杜词源广更深，数篇春涨渺云岑。\n争如一首修楼记，妙写仁人出处心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41970,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其七","author":"胡寅","text":"玄德骁雄世所知，蛟龙宁肯在污池。\n馆于贰室谋何陋，借与全荆意自奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41971,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其五","author":"胡寅","text":"虏马超江又饮湖，湖中今有卧龙无。\n青蛇袖手将何用，漫说飞仙胆气粗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41972,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其九","author":"胡寅","text":"有时风浪战城西，何啻渔阳万鼓鼙。\n狎水蚩蚩忘垫溺，谁人能续偃虹堤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41973,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其六","author":"胡寅","text":"汨潭桂酒奠三闾，尚想夷犹泛五潴。\n进退存亡皆有义，怀沙处死是何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41974,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其八","author":"胡寅","text":"风烈言言滕子京，岂于荒怪未全明。\n尼姑狡狯遥相幻，雷电那知有姓名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41975,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岳阳楼杂咏十二绝 其十","author":"胡寅","text":"大手文章浪得名，佐王功业亦何成。\n独馀不證元忠事，努力还因宋广平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41976,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将归南岳黎才翁命萧复来相迎且以二诗见贶因作一绝谢之","author":"胡寅","text":"涑水分携首重回，南山指日可徘徊。\n殷勤问讯烦甥友，更遣新诗两咏来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41977,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题四画 屏山夜雪","author":"胡寅","text":"熟醉莲荡风，未赏梅溪胜。\n踏雪访屏山，今年得乘兴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41978,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思归八绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"昨日春风花满山，回头秋叶锦斑斑。\n终年窃禄惭忧寄，何事迟留久未还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41979,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思归八绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"天柱峰前又一区，已闻松菊渐荒芜。\n近来更草归田赋，敢以无功恋左符。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41980,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思归八绝 其四","author":"胡寅","text":"夜梦俞音出帝闱，朝来江雨已生肥。\n扁舟载酒吹长笛，未减辽东独鹤归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41981,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思归八绝 其七","author":"胡寅","text":"传家素业祗图书，永日沉涵乐有馀。\n方信此心无所著，山林钟鼎一蘧庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41982,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思归八绝 其三","author":"胡寅","text":"壮时尝有意功名，不觉星星白发生。\n眼亦渐花心更短，归与犹可事农耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41983,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思归八绝 其五","author":"胡寅","text":"上圣心唯赤子矜，庶邦可以佐军兴。\n自书政拙催科考，今古舂陵复永陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41984,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思归八绝 其八","author":"胡寅","text":"画角声中欸乃歌，野人应未许云和。\n扣船我欲赓馀唱，更沐西风雨一蓑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41985,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思归八绝 其六","author":"胡寅","text":"屡督平反狱易空，深惭龙断货谁笼。\n后来倘念全齐寄，应筑虚堂致盖公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41986,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拜大父中大茔和彦达","author":"胡寅","text":"仙翁真气与神游，宰树参天也不樛。\n怅念青春家塾日，共闻规训有源流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41987,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日幽居示仲固彦冲十绝 其九","author":"胡寅","text":"菊本离离趁雨栽，杞根成垄更深培。\n诗人自古无供给，倘有敲门载酒来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41988,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日幽居示仲固彦冲十绝 其八","author":"胡寅","text":"晚菘争上碧瑶簪，芥也芳心苦复甘。\n未见菜头论白黑，何人携钵肯同参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41989,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日幽居示仲固彦冲十绝 其四","author":"胡寅","text":"人日春愁连上元，薄寒吹雨罩花村。\n传柑说道升平复，梦断鳌灯放五门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41990,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日幽居示仲固彦冲十绝 其七","author":"胡寅","text":"红含宿雨两三枝，净插铜瓶浥注之。\n不是灵芸初一见，也非迷路武陵时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41991,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日幽居示仲固彦冲十绝 其六","author":"胡寅","text":"花事先从桃李来，海棠红杏即相催。\n化工节度重重好，护得山丹最后开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41992,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日幽居示仲固彦冲十绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"碧沙承水漾娇春，弱柳萦烟作浅颦。\n正好追寻沂上侣，未须攀赠灞桥人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41993,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日幽居示仲固彦冲十绝 其五","author":"胡寅","text":"微茫烟溆见人家，四合青山雨遍遮。\n画出江乡二三月，河豚安得配芦芽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41994,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日幽居示仲固彦冲十绝 其十","author":"胡寅","text":"染溪曾是竹千竿，岁久生鳞化碧滩。\n赖有龙孙振根拨，且须深蛰捍涛澜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41995,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日幽居示仲固彦冲十绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"映空微雨不成丝，约勒桃花欲动时。\n争奈东风有情思，晓红轻笑竹边枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41996,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病中有感","author":"胡寅","text":"武侯辅世侔伊尹，明道传心继孟轲。\n五十四年而已矣，小儒如此岂非多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41997,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄倅生日送茶寿之","author":"胡寅","text":"北苑仙芽紫玉方，年年包篚贡甘香。\n愿君饮罢风生腋，飞到蓬莱日月长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41998,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登上封三绝 其三","author":"胡寅","text":"北斗回杓正指西，丹梯从此与天齐。\n为君挹注银潢水，一洗人间火宅迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":41999,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登上封三绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"仰止高高几梦思，跻攀乘兴遂忘疲。\n直须驻足青冥上，方信前山次第卑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42000,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登上封三绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"山下阴睛只蔽亏，山中烟霭更迷离。\n天风忽与游人便，吴楚屯云万里披。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42001,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪旁大楮为水所浸将蹶有感","author":"胡寅","text":"树引江流得自滋，不虞波浪齧根基。\n愿言捧土加培植，长荫行人暍暑时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42002,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧泉芍药四首 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"林影溪光风力微，黄鹂隔叶啭还飞。\n从教万点飘浮去，赖有庭花愿不违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42003,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧泉芍药四首 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"晕紫层红各自花，翠痕稠叶整还斜。\n有情岂必含春泪，自是殷勤管岁华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42004,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题四画 潭溪秋碧","author":"胡寅","text":"秋容何处佳，淡泊寄寒水。\n无滓湛遥天，我心正如此。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42005,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题上饶半月岩四绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"何年落月挂苍山，长似瑶梳插翠鬟。\n拟琢半轮营魄处，莫教如玦只如环。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42006,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题上饶半月岩四绝 其三","author":"胡寅","text":"每见云端上下弦，遥怜破镜两娟娟。\n愿移此景蟾宫去，日月当令一再圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42007,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题上饶半月岩四绝 其四","author":"胡寅","text":"非关狡兔月中藏，肯与痴蟆饱寸肠。\n只恐世人嫌冷看，故依云岫掩寒光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42008,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题上饶半月岩四绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"琼楼玉宇匝天开，织女天孙静往来。\n月姊故应羞老退，谴除私馆堕岩隈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42009,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题云峰齐云阁示住山思达二绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"舒捲高低晴复阴，澹然无滓亦无心。\n不知底处相齐得，且倚危栏一散襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42010,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题云峰齐云阁示住山思达二绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"秀色参差千万端，浩然无碍碧天宽。\n上人若见相齐处，试与凭栏指似看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42011,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题石头庵","author":"胡寅","text":"剥落烟云秋晚晴，身心无累此閒行。\n正听万壑松风满，想见西南新月生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42012,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题刘练师屋壁","author":"胡寅","text":"谁言无路出尘氛，丹灶初闻一语真。\n窗外未堆千嶂玉，坐中先盎一壶春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42013,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题净明观","author":"胡寅","text":"长官冰操正飘缨，叹息东流宰木青。\n佳句不随方士化，故应留作换鹅经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42014,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题净明观用旧韵简黎才翁","author":"胡寅","text":"得酒相逢笑绝缨，而今双鬓不全青。\n蓬莱尚说三四浅，何况方平与蔡经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42015,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题岳麓西轩三绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"月户风窗悄不扃，静中真乐故难名。\n山泉未识幽人意，自作穿林写壑声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42016,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题岳麓西轩三绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"偶向红尘得此生，岁寒松竹尚多情。\n道人亦有生前契，幽处开轩巧见迎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42017,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题岳麓西轩三绝 其三","author":"胡寅","text":"山雨冥濛久未晴，袖中长笛为君横。\n一声吹破浮云色，归去呼船载月明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42018,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题指南轩二绝 其二","author":"胡寅","text":"轩辕逸驾已旋归，赤水玄珠却背驰。\n南去北来何处是，坐令杨子泣多岐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42019,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题指南轩二绝 其一","author":"胡寅","text":"老屋萧疏四五椽，瓦炉香冷断诸缘。\n客来若问名轩意，莫似维摩但默然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42020,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题浯溪小景","author":"胡寅","text":"卜宅元郎岂偶然，江山千古共流传。\n乾坤巨石知多少，待看中兴第二篇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":42021,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]